<title>FINLAND: Finland joins EU Iran ambassador recall.</title>
<headline>Finland joins EU Iran ambassador recall.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland on Friday followed the European Union lead and recalled its ambassador to Iran, a foreign ministry spokesman said.</p>
<p>The EU move follows Thursday's ruling by a court in Germany accusing Iran's leaders of having sanctioned the murders of a group of Iranian Kurdish leaders in a Berlin restaurant in 1992.</p>
</text>
